---
import SiteHeader from '../SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../SiteFooter.astro';

const prefix = Astro.locals.marketConfig.urlPrefix;
---
<SiteHeader />

<main class="about">

  <!-- ══ HERO ══ -->
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/home/m1.avif" />
      <img src="/home/d1.avif" alt="Mir Kash" />
    </picture>
    <div class="ab-hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ab-hero__overlay">
      <p class="ab-eyebrow ab-eyebrow--light">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="ab-hero__line">A beautiful bag shouldn&rsquo;t cost the earth. Or anything on it.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ BELIEF ══ -->
  <section class="ab-center ab-belief">
    <p class="ab-lead">Mir Kash was built around a simple belief &mdash; that wanting something beautiful and wanting a kinder world are not in conflict.</p>
    <p class="ab-body ab-body--wide">Choosing vegan shouldn&rsquo;t mean a wardrobe that looks like a compromise. It should mean the opposite &mdash; every piece reflecting both your taste and your values, with neither undermining the other. We make for women who think about what they buy. Not anxiously. Quietly, certainly &mdash; women who have stopped apologising for having taste.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ MATERIALS (image + text) ══ -->
  <section class="ab-split">
    <div class="ab-split__img">
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/home/m6.avif" />
        <img src="/home/d6.avif" alt="Apple leather bag" loading="lazy" />
      </picture>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-split__text">
      <p class="ab-eyebrow">The Material</p>
      <h2 class="ab-h2">Not leather. <em>Better.</em></h2>
      <p class="ab-body">Our hero material is apple leather from Italy &mdash; made from the pulp and skin left over from the juice industry, dried and bound into supple sheets. No animal hides. No tanning chemicals. Just a material that feels like leather, wears like leather, and leaves nothing behind that shouldn&rsquo;t be there.</p>
      <a class="ab-link" href={`${prefix}/pages/materials`}>Explore our materials &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ FULL-BLEED BREAK ══ -->
  <section class="ab-full">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/home/m4.avif" />
      <img src="/home/d4.avif" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    </picture>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ CRAFT ══ -->
  <section class="ab-center ab-craft">
    <p class="ab-eyebrow">The Craft</p>
    <h2 class="ab-h2 ab-h2--center">Made slowly</h2>
    <p class="ab-body ab-body--wide">Every bag is handmade in our Jaipur atelier. We go through long testing and trialling until the texture, the structure and the weight feel exactly right &mdash; then it is cut, stitched and finished by hand, one piece at a time. We would rather take longer and get it right. Built for years, not seasons, and backed by a one-year warranty.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ THE THREE VOWS ══ -->
  <section class="ab-vows">
    <div class="ab-vow"><span class="ab-vow__n">01</span><p>We never use animal products.</p></div>
    <div class="ab-vow"><span class="ab-vow__n">02</span><p>We never rush a product.</p></div>
    <div class="ab-vow"><span class="ab-vow__n">03</span><p>We never treat sustainability as a selling point rather than a baseline.</p></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ FOUNDER ══ -->
  <section class="ab-center ab-founder">
    <p class="ab-eyebrow">The Founder</p>
    <p class="ab-founder__quote">Rajul Daga started Mir Kash because she couldn&rsquo;t find a bag she loved that she could also feel good about. The brand is an extension of that &mdash; proof that taste and conscience were never meant to be a trade&#8209;off.</p>
    <p class="ab-sig">Rajul Daga</p>
    <p class="ab-sig__role">Founder, Mir Kash</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ PULL-QUOTE BAND ══ -->
  <section class="ab-band">
    <p class="ab-band__line">Made slowly. Worn forever. <em>Hurts nothing.</em></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ CLOSING CTA ══ -->
  <section class="ab-cta">
    <p class="ab-cta__line">Fewer things. Better made.</p>
    <div class="ab-cta__links">
      <a href={`${prefix}/shop`}>Explore the collection &rarr;</a>
      <a href={`${prefix}/pages/materials`}>Our materials &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<SiteFooter />

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --serif: 'Jost', -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    --cherry: #8B1A1A;
    --depth: #2C1A0E;
  }
  body { background: #fff; }
  .hdr-menu-btn { display: none; }
  .site-header--minimal .logo { grid-column: 2; justify-self: center; }
  .site-header--minimal .logo img { height: 22px; }
  .site-header--minimal .hdr-right { grid-column: 3; justify-self: end; gap: 14px; }

  .about { background: #fff; color: var(--depth); }
  .about em { font-style: normal; color: var(--cherry); }

  /* Shared eyebrow / body */
  .ab-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: var(--tr-caps, .14em); text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500; color: var(--cherry); margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .ab-eyebrow--light { color: #fff; opacity: .85; }
  .ab-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4a4038; margin: 0; }
  .ab-body--wide { max-width: 62ch; }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-hero { position: relative; width: 100%; height: clamp(440px, 80vh, 780px); overflow: hidden; }
  .ab-hero picture, .ab-hero img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ab-hero__scrim {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.05) 45%, rgba(0,0,0,.5) 100%);
  }
  .ab-hero__overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;
    text-align: center; padding: 0 var(--gutter) clamp(48px, 8vh, 96px);
  }
  .ab-hero__line {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.6vw, 56px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 20ch; margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Centered text sections ─────────────────────────── */
  .ab-center {
    max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 120px) var(--gutter);
  }
  .ab-center .ab-body--wide { margin: 0 auto; }
  .ab-lead {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: var(--depth);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px); line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 24ch; margin: 0 auto 26px;
  }
  .ab-belief { padding-bottom: clamp(40px, 7vw, 80px); }

  /* ── Headline ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: var(--depth);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 46px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .ab-h2--center { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  /* ── Image + text split ─────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-split {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 72px); max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px) var(--gutter);
  }
  .ab-split__img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; overflow: hidden; background: #f6f3ee; }
  .ab-split__img img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ab-split__text { max-width: 34rem; }
  .ab-link {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: var(--tr-caps, .14em); text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--depth); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--depth);
    padding-bottom: 3px; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .ab-link:hover { color: var(--cherry); border-color: var(--cherry); }

  /* ── Full-bleed break ───────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-full { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 6.5; overflow: hidden; background: #f6f3ee; }
  .ab-full img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

  /* ── Three vows ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-vows {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);
    max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 104px) var(--gutter);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule, #e4dfd7); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule, #e4dfd7);
  }
  .ab-vow { text-align: center; }
  .ab-vow__n {
    display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: var(--cherry);
    font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .ab-vow p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--depth); margin: 0; max-width: 26ch; margin-inline: auto; }

  /* ── Founder ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-founder__quote {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: var(--depth);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 30px); line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 30ch; margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }
  .ab-sig { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 20px; color: var(--depth); margin: 0; }
  .ab-sig__role {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: var(--tr-caps, .14em); text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft, #a8a39c); margin: 6px 0 0;
  }

  /* ── Pull-quote band ────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-band {
    background: #b09090; text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(72px, 12vw, 160px) var(--gutter);
  }
  .ab-band__line {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 54px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 18ch; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ab-band em { color: #fff; opacity: .78; font-style: normal; }

  /* ── Closing CTA ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-cta { text-align: center; padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 104px) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-cta__line {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; color: var(--depth);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px); margin: 0 0 26px;
  }
  .ab-cta__links { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 14px 40px; }
  .ab-cta__links a {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: var(--tr-caps, .14em); text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--depth); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--depth);
    padding-bottom: 3px; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .ab-cta__links a:hover { color: var(--cherry); border-color: var(--cherry); }

  /* ── Mobile ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ab-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .ab-split__text { max-width: none; }
    .ab-vows { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 34px; text-align: center; }
    .ab-full { aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; }
    .ab-body { font-size: 14.5px; }
  }
</style>
